1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
City… or not city? China builds a whole one out of ice.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,600
Every winter, Harbin raises an ice city from frozen Songhua River blocks.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:10,000
This year's is the biggest yet — about 1.25 million square metres.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,200
That's roughly 175 football fields of towers and slides, lit up at night.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,300
It opens in December and melts by spring. Walk it, or skip the cold? Tell me below.
